{"id": "EUVD-2026-81032", "enisaUuid": "cb779375-a9d6-376e-ac0f-172fc3c21a85", "description": "OpenCVE versions 2.4.0 before 3.1.0 fails to properly scope the organizations API endpoint to the token's organization, instead returning the token creator's memberships. Attackers with organization-scoped tokens can list and retrieve every organization their creator belongs to, bypassing intended token isolation boundaries.", "datePublished": "2026-09-16T20:32:30", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-26T13:30:00", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/opencve/opencve/issues/744", "https://github.com/opencve/opencve/releases/tag/v3.1.0", "https://github.com/opencve/opencve/security/advisories/GHSA-xvpw-4gpp-w7h7", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/opencve-organization-api-ignores-token-scope"], "aliases": ["GHSA-chx7-hm9p-hcvg", "CVE-2026-92764"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.37, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "428a8aae-1d14-32a4-bb67-9c1e297fc934", "product": {"name": "opencve", "vendor": {"name": "opencve"}}, "product_version": "2.4.0 <3.1.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "bfb410f4-fc29-3a70-932e-c2dd37efa7aa", "vendor": {"name": "opencve"}}], "isExploited": false}